    <string name="home_privacy_note">Messages and files travel only over a direct, encrypted peer connection. Public DHT nodes, UDP trackers and STUN servers help the two devices find each other; no server stores, forwards or reads chat content.</string>
    <string name="home_direct_only_note">A direct connection cannot exist on every network (carrier-grade NAT, symmetric NAT, strict firewalls, some VPNs). There is no relay fallback, so the app reports failure instead of routing your messages through a third party.</string>
